<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>
    <%= title %>
  </title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/index.css">
</head>

<body>
  <%- include('partials/header', { links: [ { text: 'Teams' , href: '/teams' }, ] }) %>

    <div class="sections">
      <div class="PokeInventoryText">
        <h1>Welcome to PokéInventory!</h1>
        <p>Your one-stop app for managing your Pokémon teams and inventory.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Create and manage multiple teams:</strong> Easily create new teams, add or remove Pokémon, and
            keep track of your favorite lineups.</li>
          <li><strong>Pokémon inventory management:</strong> Store and organize all your caught Pokémon in one place,
            making it easy to find and manage them.</li>
          <li><strong>User-friendly interface:</strong> Navigate through the app with ease using our intuitive design
            and layout.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Get started by creating a new team or exploring your existing teams!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="PokeInventoryText">
        <h2>About PokéInventory</h2>
        <p>PokéInventory is designed for Pokémon trainers who want to keep their teams and inventory organized. Whether
          you're a casual player or a competitive battler, our app provides the tools you need to manage your Pokémon
          effectively.</p>
        <p>With PokéInventory, you can focus on what matters most – training and battling with your favorite Pokémon!
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
</body>

</html>